1
00:00:02,360 --> 00:00:03,840
你看到了吗
Did you see it?

2
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:04,920
她知道吗
Does she know?

3
00:00:05,480 --> 00:00:07,800
千万别让她知道了
This is the last thing she needs today.

4
00:00:08,140 --> 00:00:08,420
别看
No!

5
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:10,540
今天邓菲家可忙了
Busy day at the Dunphy compound.

6
00:00:10,720 --> 00:00:11,560
晚上要参加婚礼
We have a wedding tonight,

7
00:00:11,570 --> 00:00:13,470
下午克莱尔要和杜恩·贝利辩论
and this afternoon, Claire is debating Duane Bailey

8
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:14,660
竞选镇议员
in the race for town council.

9
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:17,960
而现在 《每周救星》报上说
And now the "Weekly Saver" says

10
00:00:17,960 --> 00:00:19,960
一些选民认为克莱尔
that some voters find Claire-- quote--

11
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:22,200
"脾气暴躁 讨人嫌"
"Angry and unlikable."

12
00:00:22,820 --> 00:00:24,800
我想对这些选民说
To those voters, I say,

13
00:00:24,920 --> 00:00:26,140
"等她发现了 再让你们见识真正的暴躁"
"Wait till she sees this."

14
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:28,680
千万别告诉她
No one can mention it to her.

15
00:00:28,680 --> 00:00:31,120
不能让这些无厘头的民意调查
We can't have some unscientific poll

16
00:00:31,120 --> 00:00:32,480
打击克莱尔的信心
shaking Claire's confidence.

17
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:33,080
菲尔
Phil...

18
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:35,880
-什么民调 -完了 她知道了
- What poll? -Too late. She knows.

19
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:37,480
谁告诉她的
Who told her?

20
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:39,780
-干嘛 要搞政治迫害吗 -我的天啊
- What is this, a witch hunt? - Oh, my god.

21
00:00:41,020 --> 00:00:41,980
我得挂了
I have to go.

22
00:00:43,660 --> 00:00:45,080
我觉得这没啥大不了的
Well, I just don't think it's a big deal.

23
00:00:45,220 --> 00:00:46,820
没多少人会读这《每周...》叫啥来着
I mean, how many people read the "Weekly..."

24
00:00:46,820 --> 00:00:49,000
-《救星》 -《救星》 随便吧
- "Saver"? -"Saver," anyway?

25
00:00:49,220 --> 00:00:50,760
22000左右吧
22,000... ish.

26
00:00:52,284 --> 00:00:53,850
我们公司
My company adver--

27
00:00:53,860 --> 00:00:56,140
曾经在这报纸上登过广告
used to advertise with that newspaper.

28
00:00:56,740 --> 00:00:59,000
我怎么就脾气暴躁兼讨人嫌了
And how am I angry and unlikable?

29
00:00:59,420 --> 00:01:00,260
我能回答这个问题吗
Can I take this one?

30
00:01:00,400 --> 00:01:01,240
劝你别
I wouldn't.

31
00:01:01,520 --> 00:01:02,260
你现在就很暴躁
You seem angry now.

32
00:01:02,380 --> 00:01:03,920
是这民意调查惹的
I am angry, at that poll.

33
00:01:04,020 --> 00:01:06,480
我觉得是因为你大吼大叫 说话得温柔点儿
I think it's the yelling. I would tone down the yelling.

34
00:01:06,580 --> 00:01:08,180
宝贝 我不会无缘无故大吼
Honey, I don't yell for no reason.

35
00:01:08,680 --> 00:01:10,740
老师说我"与众不同" 你就冲她吼
You yelled at my teacher for calling me "special."

36
00:01:10,980 --> 00:01:12,840
宝贝 她那不是夸你
Honey, that was not a compliment.

37
00:01:13,300 --> 00:01:16,200
-亲 你不讨人嫌 -谢谢
- Sweetheart, you're not unlikable. - Thank you.

38
00:01:16,240 --> 00:01:17,580
你只是看起来讨人嫌
You just seem unlikable.

39
00:01:17,660 --> 00:01:19,780
但如果我们努把力 问题就能解决
But if we work on it, it's totally fixable.

40
00:01:19,920 --> 00:01:22,060
怎么解决 菲尔 我们怎么"努把力"
How? How, Phil? How are we gonna "Work on it"?

41
00:01:22,080 --> 00:01:23,980
首先 收收你这脾气
First of all, lose the snippy attitude.

42
00:01:23,994 --> 00:01:26,386
然后 要不我们来个模拟辩论吧
And I don't know--maybe we could have a mock debate.

43
00:01:26,400 --> 00:01:27,260
好主意
Oh. Good idea.

44
00:01:27,269 --> 00:01:29,091
这样一来 妈就可以演练一下发表政见了
That way, mom can rehearse her views on the issues.

45
00:01:29,100 --> 00:01:30,400
是啊 而且我们可以帮她指出
Yeah, and we can point out all the little things

46
00:01:30,400 --> 00:01:31,740
不讨选民喜欢的小细节
she does that turn people off.

47
00:01:32,600 --> 00:01:34,860
比如这副表情 你得改改
Like that look. I would lose that look.

48
00:01:38,180 --> 00:01:39,060
看得我发毛 不过好多了
Spooky, but better.

49
00:01:51,620 --> 00:01:53,840
好的 非常感谢
All right. Thank you very much.

50
00:01:54,500 --> 00:01:56,640
嘿 莉莉 快过来 宝贝
Hey, Lily! Come here, honey!

51
00:01:57,040 --> 00:01:59,360
嗨 你知道这是什么吗
Hi! Do you know what this is?

52
00:01:59,520 --> 00:02:00,320
是盒子
A box.

53
00:02:00,960 --> 00:02:02,740
-裹着什么 -她不懂"裹着"这个词
- Containing? -She doesn't know "containing."

54
00:02:02,820 --> 00:02:05,040
就得这样教她新词汇 言传身教
Well, that's how she learns new words, by us using them.

55
00:02:05,050 --> 00:02:06,570
你整天灌输一些超难词汇
Or, that's how we lower her self-esteem,

56
00:02:06,580 --> 00:02:08,800
也可能打击她的自尊啊
by bombarding her with confusing vocabulary.

57
00:02:09,040 --> 00:02:10,700
盒子里裹着什么
What's the box containing?

58
00:02:11,140 --> 00:02:11,740
说了吧
Told you.

59
00:02:12,060 --> 00:02:13,480
好吧 是你的裙子
Okay. It's your dress.

60
00:02:13,680 --> 00:02:14,920
终于送到了
It's finally here!

61
00:02:16,080 --> 00:02:17,560
每个小女孩都梦想着
It's every little girl's dream

62
00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:19,040
成为婚礼上的花童
to be a flower girl in a wedding.

63
00:02:19,260 --> 00:02:20,840
这是莉莉大放异彩的机会
It's Lily's chance to shine.

64
00:02:20,850 --> 00:02:22,990
我做过三次捧戒指的戒童
I was a 3-time ring bearer.

65
00:02:23,160 --> 00:02:25,100
这是莉莉大放异彩的机会
It's lily's chance to shine.

66
00:02:28,856 --> 00:02:30,089
真漂亮
Pretty!

67
00:02:30,100 --> 00:02:31,100
哦不 小卡
Oh, no, Cam--

68
00:02:31,110 --> 00:02:33,283
小卡 穿这身她会像牧羊女小波波
Cam, she's gonna look like little bo peep.

69
00:02:33,293 --> 00:02:34,950
或是牧羊女穷波波
Or little bo cheap.

70
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:36,920
看这料子 都已经起毛球了
Look at this fabric. It's already pilling.

71
00:02:36,930 --> 00:02:38,250
穿上身可能会好看点儿
Maybe it look better on?

72
00:02:38,260 --> 00:02:40,360
你是说把灯开上吗
You mean turned on?

73
00:02:40,540 --> 00:02:42,060
不 不行 小卡啊
No, it does not--Cam!

74
00:02:43,040 --> 00:02:44,000
我喜欢
I love it!

75
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:44,960
不 不喜欢
No, you don't.

76
00:02:45,200 --> 00:02:47,440
我的天 我们真的要给她穿这个吗
Oh, my gosh. Are we really gonna let her wear this?

77
00:02:47,460 --> 00:02:49,520
如果新娘想来场俗气婚礼
You know what? If the bride wants to have a tacky wedding,

78
00:02:49,760 --> 00:02:50,860
就让她俗气去吧
She can have a tacky wedding.

79
00:02:50,871 --> 00:02:52,609
-咱家莉莉就成"亮"点了 -够"亮"的
- Lily will be the bright spot. - Literally.

80
00:02:52,620 --> 00:02:54,140
说出来就后悔了
Heard it as soon as I said it.

81
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:55,800
斯黛拉
Stella!

82
00:02:58,020 --> 00:02:59,780
我的小乖乖呢
Where's my good girl?

83
00:03:02,025 --> 00:03:03,928
歌洛莉亚 斯黛拉在楼上吗
Gloria, is stella up there?

84
00:03:03,940 --> 00:03:06,060
不在 但我在
No. But I am.

85
00:03:06,060 --> 00:03:09,020
你回家怎么不跟自己老婆打招呼呢
Why don't you say "hello" your wife when you come home?

86
00:03:09,280 --> 00:03:11,190
那你怎么不在门口摇着尾巴迎接我呢
Well, why don't you greet me at the door, wagging your tail?

87
00:03:12,260 --> 00:03:14,060
斯黛拉 宝贝 你在哪儿
Stella, honey! Where are you?

88
00:03:15,100 --> 00:03:15,520
斯黛拉
Stella!

89
00:03:17,120 --> 00:03:17,980
我的宝贝啊
My baby!

90
00:03:19,260 --> 00:03:21,320
斯黛拉 我来啦 我来啦
Stella, I'm coming! I'm coming!

91
00:03:26,697 --> 00:03:29,369
你没事吧 没事吧
You okay? You okay?

92
00:03:29,780 --> 00:03:31,740
你怎么穿着衣服游泳啊
Why are you swimming in your clothes?

93
00:03:31,920 --> 00:03:33,920
身材太差 不好意思穿泳裤出来秀
Because I'm self-conscious about my body.

94
00:03:34,140 --> 00:03:35,340
斯黛拉掉进池子里了
Stella fell in the pool.

95
00:03:35,340 --> 00:03:37,600
都是我不好 我放她出来
It's my fault. I let her out,

96
00:03:37,600 --> 00:03:39,220
然后我忙着弄优惠券 走不开
and then I got caught up in my couponing.

97
00:03:39,760 --> 00:03:41,140
有游泳课的优惠券吗
Any coupons for swim lessons?

98
00:03:41,150 --> 00:03:42,772
斯黛拉得学学
'Cause Stella needs some.

99
00:03:42,782 --> 00:03:44,750
有没搞错啊 你教曼尼学游泳
Seriously? Manny you teach to swim

100
00:03:44,760 --> 00:03:46,040
就是把他扔水里自己扑腾
by throwing him in the pool,

101
00:03:46,280 --> 00:03:48,200
却让狗去参加游泳班
but the dog gets swimming lessons?

102
00:03:48,620 --> 00:03:50,960
我得说 那么学虽然痛苦 但很有效
I gotta say, it was unpleasant but effective.

103
00:03:51,080 --> 00:03:52,740
我们必须教会斯黛拉游泳
We have to teach Stella how to swim.

104
00:03:52,740 --> 00:03:53,660
不然 她会淹死的
Otherwise, she could drown.

105
00:03:53,760 --> 00:03:55,700
你为啥不教她别往池子里跳呢
Why don't you teach her not to jump in the pool?

106
00:03:55,780 --> 00:03:57,700
她不是跳下去的 她是掉下去的
She didn't jump in the pool. She fell in the pool.

107
00:03:58,060 --> 00:03:59,920
如果她不会游泳
Why, suddenly, would she jump in the pool

108
00:03:59,920 --> 00:04:00,980
怎么会突然跳进池子呢
when she doesn't know how to swim?

109
00:04:01,020 --> 00:04:02,860
那她为什么冲着吸尘器叫呢
Why does she bark at the vacuum?

110
00:04:03,200 --> 00:04:05,960
吸尘器是个东西 永远不会跟你玩的
It's a thing. It is never going to play with you.

111
00:04:06,320 --> 00:04:08,060
你是说斯黛拉蠢吗
Are you saying that Stella is stupid?

112
00:04:08,180 --> 00:04:09,360
你这是捂着她耳朵吗
Are you covering her ears?

113
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:10,780
有点儿同情心好吧
Let's have a little compassion.

114
00:04:11,080 --> 00:04:13,960
她刚死里逃生 还心有余悸呢
She's probably still traumatized from her near-death experience.

115
00:04:15,300 --> 00:04:16,800
又来了 搞什么啊
Again? What's happening?!

116
00:04:17,067 --> 00:04:18,671
别
Ay, no!

117
00:04:19,740 --> 00:04:21,620
欢迎两位候选人 邓菲太太
Welcome, candidates. Mrs. Dunphy...

118
00:04:21,760 --> 00:04:22,660
感谢给我这个机会
Thank you for having me.

119
00:04:22,780 --> 00:04:23,980
还有贝利议员
And councilman Bailey.

120
00:04:24,140 --> 00:04:25,360
谢谢你 艾丽克斯
Gosh, thank you so much, Alex.

121
00:04:25,440 --> 00:04:26,580
很荣幸能站在这里
I'm deeply honored to be here,

122
00:04:26,580 --> 00:04:29,020
我将一如既往地为人民服务
and I remain, as ever, a humble servant

123
00:04:29,020 --> 00:04:30,820
为我们最伟大的小镇
to the greatest little town

124
00:04:30,831 --> 00:04:32,585
在这最棒的
in the greatest darn--

125
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:33,400
翻白眼
Eye-rolling.

126
00:04:34,580 --> 00:04:35,140
我翻着玩儿的
Playful eye rolling.

127
00:04:35,280 --> 00:04:38,740
我们选民哪会知道你是玩儿 我觉得这不好
How do we, as voters, know it's playful? I would avoid it.

128
00:04:38,860 --> 00:04:40,060
好 不翻白眼
Okay. No eye rolling.

129
00:04:41,077 --> 00:04:42,627
而且别这么抿嘴
And don't purse your lips like that.

130
00:04:42,640 --> 00:04:43,480
看起来像生气了
It makes you look annoyed.

131
00:04:45,380 --> 00:04:46,640
而且别摸脸
And don't touch your face.

132
00:04:46,650 --> 00:04:48,710
是啊 别摸脸 这样显得紧张
Yeah, no face touching. Seems nervous.

133
00:04:48,720 --> 00:04:50,220
你们这太主观了
Some of this is subjective.

134
00:04:51,598 --> 00:04:53,367
-又怎么了 -你发脾气了
- What? What now? - Anger.

135
00:04:53,380 --> 00:04:54,600
你似乎在指责我们
It looks like you're scolding us.

136
00:04:55,420 --> 00:04:56,880
那我这么叉着腰吧
I will keep my hands at my sides.

137
00:04:56,900 --> 00:04:58,300
别叉屁股上 你不是超人
Not on your hips. You're not superman.

138
00:04:59,120 --> 00:05:00,280
我们能开始了吗
Can we get started?

139
00:05:00,280 --> 00:05:01,200
我们还没开始吗
We haven't started?

140
00:05:01,200 --> 00:05:02,880
我准备了些问题
I've prepared some questions.

141
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:04,120
哦 太好了 还真有问题
Oh, goody! Actual questions.

142
00:05:04,240 --> 00:05:06,600
-喇叭警告 讽刺 -赶紧提问吧
- Honk. Sarcasm. - Just go.

143
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:08,020
好吧 邓菲夫人
Okay, Mrs. Dunphy,

144
00:05:08,440 --> 00:05:10,500
您为什么要竞选镇议员呢
why are you running for local office?

145
00:05:10,800 --> 00:05:12,300
好吧 那个 问得很好
Okay, that's, um, that's good.

146
00:05:12,310 --> 00:05:14,936
我 那个 我
I... um, I--

147
00:05:14,946 --> 00:05:16,190
老妈 你应该把这些基本问题
Mom, you really shouldn't stutter

148
00:05:16,200 --> 00:05:17,680
准备得滚瓜烂熟才行
over a basic question like that.

149
00:05:17,700 --> 00:05:18,940
至少你得搞清自己竞选的理由
You should at least know why you're running.

150
00:05:19,300 --> 00:05:21,580
主持人不是应该持中立态度吗
I thought the moderator was supposed to be objective.

151
00:05:21,760 --> 00:05:23,060
谁让我是这里唯一
Not if she's the only one in the room

152
00:05:23,060 --> 00:05:24,580
有过辩论经验的人
who has actual debate experience.

153
00:05:24,860 --> 00:05:26,180
再问一次 为什么参选
Now why are you running?

154
00:05:26,471 --> 00:05:28,748
我发现这个社区需要一个停车路标
I saw the need for a stop sign in--

155
00:05:28,760 --> 00:05:29,200
骗子
Liar!

156
00:05:29,500 --> 00:05:29,920
菲尔
Phil!

157
00:05:29,930 --> 00:05:32,957
我觉得你要准备好应付各种突发状况
I-I just think you should be ready for anything.

158
00:05:33,454 --> 00:05:34,750
我发现这个社区需要一个
I saw the need for a s--

159
00:05:34,760 --> 00:05:34,980
怎么了
What?

160
00:05:35,860 --> 00:05:37,120
不好意思 手滑了一下
Sorry. Accidental buzz.

161
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:39,480
我发现这个社区需要一个停车路标
I saw the need for a stop sign in my neighborhood,

162
00:05:39,580 --> 00:05:41,480
但即使我收集了必须的区民签名支持
and although I collected the necessary signatures

163
00:05:41,480 --> 00:05:43,660
并备齐了文件材料 我发现镇政府
and did the paperwork, I found local government

164
00:05:43,660 --> 00:05:45,000
依然无视此事
to be entirely unhelpful--

165
00:05:45,160 --> 00:05:47,100
-当我 又怎么了 -句子太长 让我觉得无聊
- When--what? - Too long. I'm bored.

166
00:05:47,260 --> 00:05:49,580
对 下个问题吧 感觉跟上课似的
Yeah, next question. I feel like I'm in school.

167
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:53,280
有人认为 我们的政治体制
Some say the political system is bogged down

168
00:05:53,290 --> 00:05:55,070
就是被一些思想强硬派的
by ideological hard-liners

169
00:05:55,080 --> 00:05:56,080
不妥协政策给拖了后腿
unwilling to compromise.

170
00:05:56,780 --> 00:05:59,340
贝利议员 您如何回应这种说法
How would you respond to that, councilman Bailey?

171
00:05:59,340 --> 00:06:02,720
我得求救了
I would like to use my lifeline.

172
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:04,960
我来回答
I'll take this.

173
00:06:05,480 --> 00:06:07,780
如果我当选 我会尊重各方观点
If elected, I would consider all perspectives,

174
00:06:07,780 --> 00:06:10,880
而且绝不会无视反对意见
and I would not ignore opposing viewpoints.

175
00:06:12,060 --> 00:06:13,260
救援直升机来了 你继续
Helicopter. Just keep going.

176
00:06:13,660 --> 00:06:15,620
我会尊重各方观点
I would consider all perspectives,

177
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:17,040
-而且绝不会无视反对 -下去吧
- and I wouldn't ignore opposing-- - You suck!

178
00:06:17,100 --> 00:06:17,660
卢克
Luke!

179
00:06:18,100 --> 00:06:19,540
你得准备好应付起哄者
You have to be ready for hecklers.

180
00:06:19,740 --> 00:06:20,220
没错
He's right.

181
00:06:20,980 --> 00:06:23,000
好的 从头再来 不准打断
Okay. I'm doing over. No buzzing.

182
00:06:23,500 --> 00:06:25,100
如果我当选 我
If elected, I--

183
00:06:25,680 --> 00:06:27,440
-又怎么了 -离麦克风太近了
- What? - Too close to the mic.

184
00:06:27,660 --> 00:06:28,640
菲尔 这是个梳子
Phil, it's a hairbrush.

185
00:06:29,420 --> 00:06:29,820
好吧
Okay.

186
00:06:32,060 --> 00:06:35,420
如果我当选 我会尊重各方观点
If elected, I would consider all opinions

187
00:06:35,420 --> 00:06:37,400
而且绝不会无视反对意见
and not ignore those of the opposition,

188
00:06:37,400 --> 00:06:40,060
绝不会步贝利议员六届任期施政的后尘
as councilman Bailey has done for six terms.

189
00:06:40,980 --> 00:06:42,700
又怎么了 我回答得多棒
What? That was a great answer.

190
00:06:42,880 --> 00:06:44,060
好吧 我听不下去了
Well, I couldn't hear it

191
00:06:44,060 --> 00:06:46,340
因为你把不好看的半边脸面向了观众
because you were showing me the bad side of your face.

192
00:06:46,920 --> 00:06:47,900
我有半边脸不好看吗
I have a bad side?

193
00:06:48,160 --> 00:06:49,640
-对 左半边 -不对 是右半边
- Yeah, the left. - No. It's the right.

194
00:06:50,060 --> 00:06:52,060
老爸 绝对是左半边好吧 你自己看看
Uh, dad, it's totally the left. I mean, look at it.

195
00:06:52,080 --> 00:06:53,800
宝贝 我选择睡左边是有道理的
Sweetheart, why do you think I chose my side of the bed?

196
00:06:53,900 --> 00:06:55,140
好吧 谢谢你们了
Okay! Okay. Thank you.

197
00:06:55,320 --> 00:06:57,400
谢谢我亲爱的家人们 你们真是帮了我一个"大忙"
Thank you, family. This has been super-duper helpful.

198
00:06:58,100 --> 00:07:00,340
手势 嘴唇 讽刺 翻白眼
Hands, lips, sarcasm, eye-rolling,

199
00:07:00,580 --> 00:07:01,220
不好看的半边脸
wrong side of the face.

200
00:07:01,560 --> 00:07:03,480
哦对 我发现了
Oh, yeah. Now I see it.

201
00:07:04,077 --> 00:07:05,047
就是左边
Yep.

202
00:07:07,500 --> 00:07:08,280
她准备好了
She's ready.

203
00:07:09,620 --> 00:07:11,320
像这样
And it's this,

204
00:07:11,940 --> 00:07:13,480
像这样
and it's this.

205
00:07:14,320 --> 00:07:15,240
不是这样
Not this,

206
00:07:15,700 --> 00:07:17,120
是这样
but this.

207
00:07:17,320 --> 00:07:18,860
-好了 够了小卡 -还有这样
- Okay. Okay, that's good, Cam. -And this.

208
00:07:18,870 --> 00:07:21,143
留点 留点花瓣给女儿吧
Save--let's save some petals for Lily, all right?

209
00:07:21,153 --> 00:07:22,515
好 乖女儿过来
Okay. Let's do it over here, sweetheart.

210
00:07:22,525 --> 00:07:23,348
-到这边来 -好的
- Right over here. - Okay.

211
00:07:23,740 --> 00:07:25,660
对了 就像你走向婚礼的圣坛
There you go. Oh, like you're coming down the aisle!

212
00:07:27,301 --> 00:07:28,768
一次别洒太多 不错
Not too many at once. That's good.

213
00:07:28,966 --> 00:07:30,048
很好 你做得很好 乖女儿
Okay. You're doing great, Lil.

214
00:07:30,060 --> 00:07:31,020
噢 她太棒了
Oh, she is, isn't she?

215
00:07:31,140 --> 00:07:33,220
谁看新娘啊 咱闺女才是瞩目的焦点
Forget the bride. All the eyes are gonna be on her.

216
00:07:48,760 --> 00:07:50,580
我不敢相信你居然笑出来了
I cannot believe you laughed!

217
00:07:50,580 --> 00:07:53,020
抱歉 但你知道我有两个软肋笑点
I am sorry. But you know I have two weaknesses--

218
00:07:53,260 --> 00:07:54,960
小孩爆粗口 老人唱饶舌
children cursing and old people rapping.

219
00:07:54,960 --> 00:07:57,000
小卡 我们得告诉她那词不好
Cam, we have to tell her it's a bad word.

220
00:07:57,140 --> 00:07:59,200
不行 那样只会让她觉得那词很劲爆
No. That just gives it more power.

221
00:07:59,340 --> 00:08:00,780
我们越不提起这事越好
The less we make of it, the better.

222
00:08:00,920 --> 00:08:02,640
我们就装作什么都没发生
Let's just pretend like it never happened.

223
00:08:02,640 --> 00:08:04,450
好吧 或许 或许什么都没发生
Okay. Yeah, maybe it-- maybe it didn't.

224
00:08:04,450 --> 00:08:06,400
或许是我们听错了
Maybe we--maybe we misheard.

225
00:08:06,400 --> 00:08:08,320
对 或许她说的是"卡"
Yeah. Maybe she said "Truck."

226
00:08:08,320 --> 00:08:09,800
或者"擦"
Or--or "Duck."

227
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:12,520
或者"菜" 她有可能说的是"草"
Or "Luck." She could have said "Yuck."

228
00:08:12,860 --> 00:08:14,680
爸爸 我能吃冰淇淋吗
Daddy, can I have some ice cream?

229
00:08:14,760 --> 00:08:16,900
不 宝贝儿 如果你饿了 可以吃点水果
No, honey, if you're hungry, you can have some fruit.

230
00:08:17,740 --> 00:08:18,140
水果
Fruit? .

231
00:08:21,160 --> 00:08:22,540
我有俩孩子要教育啊
I have two children.

232
00:08:30,460 --> 00:08:32,600
菲尔 这是要上电视吗
Phil? Phil, is this televised?

233
00:08:32,900 --> 00:08:35,000
我没告诉你是不想让你紧张
I didn't tell you because I didn't want to make you nervous.

234
00:08:35,280 --> 00:08:36,740
好主意 真是个好主意啊
Great plan. Really good plan.

235
00:08:36,780 --> 00:08:38,060
最后时刻 给我来个措手不及
Throw me for a curveball at the last minute.

236
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:39,920
别紧张妈 只是公共频道
Mom, chill. It's just public access.

237
00:08:40,140 --> 00:08:41,880
我们的辩论赛也上公共频道
My debate team's on public access,

238
00:08:41,880 --> 00:08:43,660
只有你们才会看而已
and the only people who watch me are you guys.

239
00:08:43,900 --> 00:08:45,100
对 每次都看
Yep. All the time.

240
00:08:45,360 --> 00:08:46,600
所以或许没人会看这个
So maybe nobody will see this?

241
00:08:46,980 --> 00:08:48,720
不 我们想让大家看到这个
No. We want people to see this.

242
00:08:48,760 --> 00:08:51,000
这样你才能当选 被人熟知才是关键
That's how you win elections. That's the whole point.

243
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:54,140
那老妈应该做些疯狂愚蠢的事
Then mom should do something so crazy and stupid.

244
00:08:54,140 --> 00:08:56,180
-可以做网络红人 -妈 千万别做网络红人
- It goes viral. - Mom, please don't go viral.

245
00:08:56,420 --> 00:08:58,760
好的 我会把这个加进严禁事宜中
Okay. I'll add that to my list of things not to do--

246
00:08:59,220 --> 00:09:01,320
别碰脸 别翻白眼
Don't touch my face, don't roll my eyes,

247
00:09:01,640 --> 00:09:02,660
别"指"点江山
don't point my fingers,

248
00:09:02,680 --> 00:09:04,120
还有绝对不做网络红人
and definitely don't go viral.

249
00:09:04,220 --> 00:09:05,720
你们还有谁对我有点信心的
Do any of you still believe in me?

250
00:09:05,820 --> 00:09:07,820
我们当然相信你 我们站在你这边
Of course we do. We're on your side.

251
00:09:07,980 --> 00:09:08,960
是右半边
The right side.

252
00:09:08,980 --> 00:09:10,100
不是左边
Not the left.

253
00:09:10,300 --> 00:09:11,620
我们去找个座位
Let's grab a seat.

254
00:09:13,811 --> 00:09:15,000
右边 左边
Right. Left.

255
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:16,920
好了 妈 要有自信
Okay. Mom, just be confident.

256
00:09:17,560 --> 00:09:20,000
凭什么 自家客厅的辩论我都输了
Based on what? I just lost a debate in my living room,

257
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:21,460
而且大家觉得我讨人嫌
and people think I'm unlikable.

258
00:09:21,580 --> 00:09:23,320
那是男人针对女强人的专用词
That's just the word men use for powerful women

259
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:24,480
因为他们感觉受到威胁
because they feel threatened.

260
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:28,000
所以忘掉一切 强势不屈 舍我其谁
So just forget everything else and be proud and powerful.

261
00:09:28,227 --> 00:09:30,140
你怎么这么聪明
How did you get so smart?

262
00:09:30,140 --> 00:09:32,100
可能我是领养的 或是在医院抱错了
I've always assumed adoption or baby switch.

263
00:09:32,840 --> 00:09:34,380
注意 不能亲吻
Hey. Hey. No kisses!

264
00:09:34,500 --> 00:09:35,400
强势不屈 舍我其谁
Proud and powerful.

265
00:09:35,480 --> 00:09:36,860
-抱歉 -也不能道歉
- Sorry. - And no apologizing.

266
00:09:37,540 --> 00:09:39,340
对 闭嘴 赶紧进去
Yes! Shut up and get in there!

267
00:09:39,400 --> 00:09:40,260
就要这个范儿
That's more like it!

268
00:09:40,940 --> 00:09:41,420
对
Yeah!

269
00:09:42,271 --> 00:09:43,421
天哪
Oh, god.

270
00:09:46,560 --> 00:09:47,620
她来了
There she is.

271
00:09:47,620 --> 00:09:49,420
-搞定他们 克莱尔 -多谢支持
- Go get 'em, Claire. -Thanks.

272
00:09:49,420 --> 00:09:51,020
别担心 我们会给你助威的
Don't worry. We're going to cheer for you

273
00:09:51,020 --> 00:09:51,920
不管你说了什么
no matter what you say.

274
00:09:52,120 --> 00:09:54,500
真好 来自亲爱家人的更多"支持"
Oh, good. More support from my loving family.

275
00:09:54,500 --> 00:09:56,380
喇叭警告 讽刺
Honk. Sarcasm.

276
00:09:56,800 --> 00:09:58,040
你怎么把斯黛拉带来了
Why'd you bring Stella?

277
00:09:58,040 --> 00:09:59,940
她总是往屋外跑 然后往泳池里跳
She keeps getting out and jumping in the pool.

278
00:10:00,220 --> 00:10:02,500
我们可不能冒险把她留在家里 她不会游泳
We don't wanna take any chances because she can't swim.

279
00:10:02,700 --> 00:10:04,220
那她为啥还老往泳池里跳
Then why does she keep jumping in the pool?

280
00:10:04,240 --> 00:10:05,820
我一直在想这个问题 我有个想法
I've been thinking about it. I got a theory.

281
00:10:06,320 --> 00:10:07,680
她可能有自杀倾向
She might be suicidal.

282
00:10:07,960 --> 00:10:09,660
什么 这也太疯狂了吧
What? That's crazy.

283
00:10:09,693 --> 00:10:12,683
这世上就没什么狗狗自杀一说
There's not such thing as doggy suicide.

284
00:10:13,287 --> 00:10:15,584
你好 我是杜恩·贝利
Hi. Duane Bailey.

285
00:10:15,760 --> 00:10:17,180
抱歉 我无意中听到你们谈话
Sorry. I couldn't help but overhear.

286
00:10:17,180 --> 00:10:18,840
我除了是人民公仆之外
In addition to being a public servant,

287
00:10:18,920 --> 00:10:21,360
还是一名获奖哈巴小猎犬饲养者
I'm also an award-winning breeder of puggles.

288
00:10:21,784 --> 00:10:24,091
我赢过最佳猎犬奖 两次哟
I've won the Puggly. Twice.

289
00:10:24,091 --> 00:10:25,760
我恐怕狗狗自杀是
And I'm afraid that doggy suicide

290
00:10:25,760 --> 00:10:27,120
确有其事的
is all too real.

291
00:10:27,380 --> 00:10:30,040
只不过主流媒体不报道罢了
It's just the mainstream media doesn't report on it,

292
00:10:30,040 --> 00:10:32,491
因为不像猫艾滋那么火爆
'cause it's not as sexy as feline A.I.D.S.

293
00:10:32,491 --> 00:10:35,740
斯黛拉没有自杀倾向 她就是比较脑残
Stella is not suicidal. She's just... estupid.

294
00:10:35,740 --> 00:10:37,620
那 或许就是您的问题了
Well, that might be part of your problem.

295
00:10:37,720 --> 00:10:38,940
她能感觉到你不喜欢她
She senses you don't like her.

296
00:10:39,060 --> 00:10:39,880
你根本想不到
You have no idea.

297
00:10:40,160 --> 00:10:41,980
从这个小天使踏进我们家门起
This one's been against this little angel

298
00:10:41,980 --> 00:10:43,000
这位就没消停过
from the very beginning.

299
00:10:43,120 --> 00:10:44,460
没错 狗狗会注意到的
Yeah, well, dogs pick up on that.

300
00:10:44,560 --> 00:10:45,640
他们很敏感的
You know, they're very sensitive.

301
00:10:46,080 --> 00:10:47,980
我喜欢叫他们
I like to call them, um...

302
00:10:47,980 --> 00:10:50,220
填不满的情感无底洞
Bottomless pits of need.

303
00:10:50,220 --> 00:10:51,520
但不能当他们的面说
But not to their face, though.

304
00:10:51,520 --> 00:10:52,700
那样太伤他们感情了
That would just destroy them.

305
00:10:52,760 --> 00:10:53,620
不是说你哟
Not you.

306
00:10:53,980 --> 00:10:55,420
那这么说是我的错啦
So now this is my fault?

307
00:10:55,440 --> 00:10:56,480
我想他知道自己在说什么
I think he knows what he's talking about.

308
00:10:56,480 --> 00:10:57,708
人家可是赢过一个最佳猎犬奖的
The man won a puggly.

309
00:10:57,708 --> 00:10:59,380
-两个 我赢过两个 -我们说完了
- Two. I won two pugglies. - We're done here.

310
00:10:59,380 --> 00:11:00,740
-在2000年和 -是是
- In 2000- - Yeah.

311
00:11:02,380 --> 00:11:04,800
你知道是哪个台播吗
Do you have any idea what station this is on?

312
00:11:04,800 --> 00:11:06,000
我上网查查[上网看]
Here, I'll look online.

313
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:08,140
是网络广播吗 你早点说我就不用
It's a webcast? That would have been helpful to know

314
00:11:08,140 --> 00:11:09,080
摁过九百个频道了
900 channels ago.

315
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:10,940
不是 是个公共频道之类的
No, it's on public access or something.

316
00:11:10,940 --> 00:11:12,700
我要看克莱尔姑妈
I wanna watch aunt claire!

317
00:11:12,700 --> 00:11:15,160
行 但是首先 宝贝 我们得谈谈
Okay. Well, first, honey, we need to talk about something.

318
00:11:15,160 --> 00:11:17,160
关于你早上说的那个词
It's about that word you said this morning.

319
00:11:17,960 --> 00:11:18,380
什么词
What word?

320
00:11:18,540 --> 00:11:20,120
你知道 就是那个以F开头的那个词
You know, the one that starts with "F"?

321
00:11:20,740 --> 00:11:22,020
-花花 -不是
- "Flower"? - No.

322
00:11:23,260 --> 00:11:24,440
-果果 -不是
- "Fruit"? - No.

323
00:11:24,700 --> 00:11:26,880
如果她记不起来了 我们干嘛要提醒她
If she doesn't remember it, we shouldn't remind her.

324
00:11:26,880 --> 00:11:28,460
因为她说了三遍呢
Oh, well, she said it three times.

325
00:11:28,460 --> 00:11:29,160
哦 你是说
Oh, you mean.

326
00:11:30,010 --> 00:11:32,369
小卡 出去
Cam, leave the room!

327
00:11:34,200 --> 00:11:36,600
不用 我能忍住
No. I can do this.

328
00:11:37,240 --> 00:11:39,340
莉莉 那是个不好的词
Lily, that is a bad word,

329
00:11:39,340 --> 00:11:41,820
而且你永远也不能再说这个词
and you are not allowed to say it ever.

330
00:11:42,060 --> 00:11:43,260
但能把你逗笑呀
But it makes you laugh.

331
00:11:43,260 --> 00:11:44,980
其实爸爸不应该笑的
Okay, well, daddy shouldn't be laughing,

332
00:11:44,980 --> 00:11:46,980
你也永远不应该说那个词
and you should never say that word.

333
00:11:47,480 --> 00:11:48,320
明白没
Do you understand?

334
00:11:48,860 --> 00:11:49,220
或许吧
Maybe.

335
00:11:50,600 --> 00:11:53,020
好吧 这可不是什么游戏 好吗
Okay. This is not a game, all right?

336
00:11:53,080 --> 00:11:54,300
如果你再说一遍那个词
If you say that word one more time,

337
00:11:54,300 --> 00:11:55,440
我就把你的玩具都没收
I'm gonna take away all your toys!

338
00:11:55,560 --> 00:11:57,460
我认真的 她知道我不是认真的
I'm serious! She knows I'm not serious.

339
00:11:58,100 --> 00:11:58,820
那婚礼怎么办
What about the wedding?

340
00:11:59,340 --> 00:12:00,580
如果她在那说怎么办
What if she says it there?

341
00:12:00,640 --> 00:12:02,020
她就像是个定时炸弹
She's like a ticking time bomb!

342
00:12:02,020 --> 00:12:04,040
-那我们怎么办 取消吗 -没错
-Well, what are we gonna do, cancel? - Yes.

343
00:12:04,040 --> 00:12:05,200
我们就这么说
Maybe we just call and say,

344
00:12:05,400 --> 00:12:07,460
在同性婚姻合法化之前 我们不参加任何婚礼
"We're not going to any more weddings until the gays can get married."

345
00:12:07,580 --> 00:12:08,700
得 咱们改走政治路线了
Oh, so now we're political?

346
00:12:08,820 --> 00:12:10,580
连"同志骄傲"游行周我们都躲出去避难
We leave town on gay pride weekend

347
00:12:10,580 --> 00:12:11,620
就因为不喜欢那拥挤的交通
because we don't like the traffic.

348
00:12:16,480 --> 00:12:20,260
但是经验的作用是无可替代的
But there's no substitute for experience.

349
00:12:21,900 --> 00:12:24,200
举例来说 我怀疑我的对手
For example, I doubt my opponent is familiar

350
00:12:24,210 --> 00:12:26,981
是否熟悉镇法26-12b
with town ordinance 26-12b...

351
00:12:26,991 --> 00:12:29,650
26-12b是关于噪声污染的
26-12b has to do with noise pollution--

352
00:12:29,660 --> 00:12:31,900
也就是您 先生 现在正造出的哟
